/** The "not legally reviewed" banner from the source page. Remove when a lawyer has reviewed the text. */
---
<div class="legal-banner" role="note">
  <p><strong>DRAFT — not legally reviewed.</strong> Have a lawyer review before publishing, especially the limitation of liability section.</p>
</div>
<style>
  .legal-banner { border: 1px solid var(--amber); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: var(--s-4) var(--s-5); margin-block: var(--s-8); }
  .legal-banner p { max-width: none; }
</style>
